eColor=#232F3E;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#232F3E;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c88" target="c89"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c96" value="&lt;b&gt;Where the Claude key goes:&lt;/b&gt; repository secret &lt;b&gt;ANTHROPIC_API_KEY&lt;/b&gt;. The diagnose job sends only the redacted tail of the failed jobs&#x27; logs, and posts the likely cause and fix to &lt;b&gt;Slack&lt;/b&gt; (secret SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL, the one alert channel) and the run&#x27;s summary page. &lt;b&gt;No AWS key exists:&lt;/b&gt; every job signs in with GitHub&#x27;s OIDC token (secret AWS_ROLE_ARN)." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#1D2433;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="1690" width="2120" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c97" value="Order for the first deployment: infra-aws -&gt; platform -&gt; app (all) -&gt; promote (all) + SYNC in Argo CD -&gt; mobile-backend. Kyverno rejects any agripulse image that is not signed with the KMS key." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#5B6475;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="1745" width="2120" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>